---
// Figma node 14196:27634 (y5774, 1224x979): gradient pixel heading + subtext,
// then a 3-column card grid (cards: #070606, border #2c2a2a, 24px radius)
// masked by a linear alpha fade — fully opaque to 51.7% of the grid height,
// transparent at the bottom (mask asset 1224x747, gradient y386.5→747).
